{"screen_name": "985elmfss", "file": "985elmfss", "name": "エルミフ", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1874700703937273856/LCz_ro41.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1487481762007552003/1748615681/1500x500", "description": "Request→https://skeb.jp/@985elmfss\nTshirt,sticker→https://elmfartworks.booth.pm/", "total_works": 16, "scraped_works": 16, "first_seen": "2026-02-16T10:32:36.238779+00:00", "last_updated": "2026-02-16T10:32:36.238779+00:00", "price_history": {"art": [{"amount": 6000, "recorded_at": "2026-02-16T10:32:36.238779+00:00"}]}, "current_prices": {"art": 6000}, "price_range": {"art": {"min": 6000, "max": 6000}}, "links": [{"label": "Twitter", "url": "https://x.com/985elmfss", "name": "985elmfss"}, {"label": "Website", "url": "https://elmfartworks.booth.pm", "name": ""}], "flags": {}, "acceptable": true, "works": [{"path": "/@985elmfss/works/16", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/dfc0cbea/uploads/origins/0879feb7-2b34-42fb-8e2b-8458854db4ea?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4d67cc473b8457ab2e9122464486d3af", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/dfc0cbea/uploads/origins/0879feb7-2b34-42fb-8e2b-8458854db4ea?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4d67cc473b8457ab2e9122464486d3af, https://si.imgix.net/dfc0cbea/uploads/origins/0879feb7-2b34-42fb-8e2b-8458854db4ea?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b3b336b20341e126c357190a9023e31b 2x, https://si.imgix.net/dfc0cbea/uploads/origins/0879feb7-2b34-42fb-8e2b-8458854db4ea?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2ae4560e5385eb8e38f00f0eb9d783af 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！\n\nDiscordの友達を通してあなたの絵を見たんだけど、僕の車の横に僕のOCの絵を描いてほしいんだ！\n\n私のOC: https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/12J0jJ662H_1Zvh9Oakuf2qdca8437LOQ\n僕の車：https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1gXV4g44kroVCKB90YcRuuDQij4tRqura\n\n車の位置は自由で